(7042880, 1070196, 161988, '<td valign="top">This photograph has such a powerful message.  I can''t imagine anyone doing a better job with this challenge than you have done.  Technically speaking your composition is spot on, lighting is great and this is perfect use of black and white. (IMHO)</td>', 'This photograph has such a powerful message.  I can''t imagine anyone doing a better job with this challenge than you have done.  Technically speaking your composition is spot on, lighting is great and this is perfect use of black and white. (IMHO)', '2013-05-24 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
