(7042882, 1070279, 161988, '<td valign="top">Such creativity. Is he kept prisoner or hiding from the world around him?  Either way he is one scared and paranoid fella. His eyes draw you into the photo and I like how you put him off center.  Your colors are bold.  I like your use of color but I wonder how black and white would have looked.  I originally gave you a 9 but after further review this is a perfect 10.  Great job!</td>', 'Such creativity. Is he kept prisoner or hiding from the world around him?  Either way he is one scared and paranoid fella. His eyes draw you into the photo and I like how you put him off center.  Your colors are bold.  I like your use of color but I wonder how black and white would have looked.  I originally gave you a 9 but after further review this is a perfect 10.  Great job!', '2013-05-24 22:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
