(7043874, 1070200, 159377, '<td valign="top">nice tone mapping, not over the top. composition includes too much clutter which may be resolved with some cropping right and bottom.</td>', 'nice tone mapping, not over the top. composition includes too much clutter which may be resolved with some cropping right and bottom.', '2013-05-27 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7043875, 1070150, 159377, '<td valign="top">nice tone mapping and skin tone, good balance. fashionable 2013 version of hat. blur or lighting in background is a bit distracting as is the pattern of the material being held. main story is in the face, everything else should support the story (the hat) or not distract from it (the complex foreground).</td>', 'nice tone mapping and skin tone, good balance. fashionable 2013 version of hat. blur or lighting in background is a bit distracting as is the pattern of the material being held. main story is in the face, everything else should support the story (the hat) or not distract from it (the complex foreground).', '2013-05-27 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7043876, 1070273, 159377, '<td valign="top">interesting composition including skew. some nice contrasts. lighting of the graffiti and sofa is only distracting as it makes them the main subject rather than setting off the model.good key lighting.</td>', 'interesting composition including skew. some nice contrasts. lighting of the graffiti and sofa is only distracting as it makes them the main subject rather than setting off the model.good key lighting.', '2013-05-27 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
