(7043929, 1069913, 106806, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure this is really Paranoia.... terror, stalking? Bloody great image and getting my top vote on the basis that is an awsomely good image, the composition and reflectiongs really drawing one into the horror and menace ..... besides which I''m a little scared I''m missing the point.</td>', 'Not quite sure this is really Paranoia.... terror, stalking? Bloody great image and getting my top vote on the basis that is an awsomely good image, the composition and reflectiongs really drawing one into the horror and menace ..... besides which I''m a little scared I''m missing the point.', '2013-05-27 18:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
