(7043944, 1070280, 153814, '<td valign="top">One of the most if not the most amazing and distinct calls of all the birds in the world. If I was in the forest at night and I heard this guys call it would make me paranoid. I would say "WHAT THE HELL IS THAT AND HOW THE HELL DID I END UP IN AUSTRALIA"?<br/>Works for me. Well done.</td>', 'One of the most if not the most amazing and distinct calls of all the birds in the world. If I was in the forest at night and I heard this guys call it would make me paranoid. I would say "WHAT THE HELL IS THAT AND HOW THE HELL DID I END UP IN AUSTRALIA"?Works for me. Well done.', '2013-05-27 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
