(7045123, 1070253, 114285, '<td valign="top">I remember going to Capetown, and when we left the airport to drive to our hotel seeing rows and rows of shanty towns with those tin roofs, shocking stuff. Then out steps these people with the nicest clothing, they love bright colours good on them, I say, they need something nice.<br/> <br/>Well depicted with the steam or smoke or whatever it is, and the 3 people add to this, my pick for 3rd.</td>', 'I remember going to Capetown, and when we left the airport to drive to our hotel seeing rows and rows of shanty towns with those tin roofs, shocking stuff. Then out steps these people with the nicest clothing, they love bright colours good on them, I say, they need something nice. Well depicted with the steam or smoke or whatever it is, and the 3 people add to this, my pick for 3rd.', '2013-05-30 11:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
