(7048464, 1070285, 158576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mikeb49:</b></div><hr/><i> image does not convey story for me. motion blur and focus blur are distracting rather than story developing. little contrast. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To me, paranoia is a a mental state full of blurred thoughts of anxiety, fear and distrust, with quick movements to avoid discovery or capture. I can see the story in this photo, that''s why I took it. I''m sorry you can''t.</td>', 'Originally posted by mikeb49: image does not convey story for me. motion blur and focus blur are distracting rather than story developing. little contrast.   To me, paranoia is a a mental state full of blurred thoughts of anxiety, fear and distrust, with quick movements to avoid discovery or capture. I can see the story in this photo, that''s why I took it. I''m sorry you can''t.', '2013-06-05 20:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
